/// Dimension table that contains information on the health of the involved parties.
/// 
/// important to know, fatally injured means that the person survived the initial accident but later passed away in the next 30 days after the accident.
/// 
/// 
/// Examples: fatally injured, with deaths, severely injured, lightly injured
/// 
